# Script & Prompt Agent Examples

[Русская версия](README_RU.md)

This directory contains real examples produced by the Custom GPT developed for the beFruitbe AI Content Pipeline.

Each example demonstrates:

- original user request;
- agent output;
- script development;
- prompt engineering;
- factuality checks;
- human-in-the-loop controls;
- production logic.

Internal identifiers, confidential Knowledge Base data and private brand documentation have been removed from the public examples.

## Examples

### Example 01 — Pineapple

[“What Happens to Pineapple Before It Becomes Part of СОКОчай?”](example-01-pineapple-en.md)
### Example 02 — Courtroom

[“The Pineapple Trial”](example-02-courtroom-en.md)

Open creative task → autonomous concept development → 6 characters → dialogue-driven script → production plan → editing logic → factuality controls → recurring content-format concept.

Short user brief → script → storyboard → AI-video prompt → production plan → factuality verification.
